// The escort freighter's AI (spec 36): convoy and chain freighters. No strategy modules: the escort objective gives every move order
// (Missions/EscortObjective.cs), as for the blind courier. With the vanilla Normal AI, its AggroEnemies module took targets on radar and,
// away from the AI origin, flew with the hull turned to the target (AIAggroEnemiesModule.TacticalRetreat), so the freighter crawled
// past every enemy on radar (#372). Its turrets aim on their own, like the Easy AI with no targeting list.
UpdateInterval = 1

StrategyModules []
TacticsModules []
TargetingModules []
CommsModules = &<./Data/ai/ai_common.rules>/CommsModulesDefault
// An escort in stasis does not move (spec 1851).
StasisModules []
